---
description: Repo constitution adapter — applies to all work in this repository
globs:
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` before any work: it is the operating guide for every agent in
this repo. This adapter adds nothing; it points.

- Design/UI work: the binding rule is `.claude/rules/design-system.md`; the
  canonical tokens are `src/styles/design-tokens.css`; the shipped components
  are `src/components/fairway/**`. Tokens beat prose. Do not use external UI
  kits, Google Fonts, or `!important`.
- Database work: `src/lib/types/database.ts` is the generated source of truth
  for every table and column; sport prefixes (`golf_`, `baseball_`,
  `helm_lifting_`) are load-bearing.
- Branch: one active session may work on the currently checked-out branch
  directly. A concurrent session takes its own worktree with
  `scripts/new-worktree.sh <task>` (it adds the workspace marker and the disk
  and checkout checks a raw `git worktree add` skips). Merging to main does not
  deploy; deploy from the linked checkout per AGENTS.md "Production".
